  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760353,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Impression: A Commodore 64 Football Management Masterpiece\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st Impression*, the definitive football management simulation for the Commodore 64! Choose from any of the top four English leagues and guide your team to glory, navigating the pressures of promotion, relegation, and fierce rivalries. \n\nMore than just matchday decisions, *1st Impression* demands strategic thinking. Scout for promising young talent, develop your players' skills through training, and carefully manage your club's finances to avoid crippling debt.  Each match delivers detailed reports, revealing player injuries, crucial results from competing teams, and a breakdown of your weekly income and expenses. \n\nExperience the thrill of victory and the agony of defeat as you build your dream team.  Will you lead your club to championship success, or will you face the harsh realities of the lower leagues?  *1st Impression* offers a deep and rewarding management experience, challenging players to prove their tactical acumen and managerial prowess.  It's the ultimate test of your footballing knowledge!"
    },
